OL,3,GNEWSACan Rushden finally swat its
OL,4,Aproblem with flies?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than a decade, people who live
OL,7,Fclose to an industrial estate in
OL,8,FRushden, Northamptonshire, say they
OL,9,Fhave been plagued by flies and a
OL,10,Fpersistent smell.
OL,12,FThe problem has been reported to the
OL,13,FEnvironment Agency (EA) who say they
OL,14,Fcontinue to monitor the situation.
OL,16,FOn Monday, the Labour MP for
OL,17,FWellingborough and Rushden, Gen
OL,18,FKitchen, called a public meeting at
OL,19,FRushden Hall for residents to air their
OL,20,Fviews. It had to move outside as the
OL,21,Froom could not hold the large number
OL,22,Fwho turned up.
